msgctxt "80"
msgid "Shimabukuro-san, can I talk to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Some punks from the Tamashiro Family came by the other day and said I have "
"to pay them protection money if I wanted to keep my store in one piece."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "I managed to shoo 'em away, but they said they'd be back..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"The Tamashiro Family, huh...? So, they think they can move in on our turf, "
"do they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "All right, then! If they come back, call me right away, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"We'll teach 'em a lesson they'll never forget. You won't have to worry about"
" them bothering you anymore!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Oh, thank you!"
msgstr ""

